attr[seg000:0083]: name = init_game_ui; comment = Startup step after play_intro/play_CREDITS_HNM/play_intro2 (called at seg000:0024). Configure the voice/subtitle language (check_amr_or_eng_language), then fall into draw_game_ui to paint the in-game HUD.
attr[seg000:0086]: name = draw_game_ui; comment = Draw the in-game UI/HUD: set fb1 active + clear it, draw every HUD element from _word_20F94_ui_elements via draw_all_ui_elements (offscreen through gfx_call_bp_with_front_buffer_as_screen), then overlay the character head-and-shoulders portrait (ui_draw_head_and_shoulders). Reused standalone from seg000:3768 to redraw the HUD.
