attr[seg000:1843]: name = ui_animate_head_down; comment = [[[
    Fold the character head portrait down before switching views. When a portrait
    is showing (ui_head_index != 0) it shows fold frame 9, waits 8 ticks, then
    frame 8 and redraws (loc_017be); a no-op when no head is shown.
]]]
attr[seg000:1860]: name = ui_enter_room_view; comment = [[[
    Switch the display into the in-game room view, then start the head portrait.
    Guard: returns immediately when data_011c9 (game-mode flags) is nonzero.
    Folds any open head portrait down (loc_01843) before switching.
    Falls into shared body loc_0186b: toggles data_000fb; when now >=0 enters the
    room view at loc_01877, else jumps to loc_05a1a (the close/leave direction).
    loc_01877 finishes the pending dissolve, resets per-scene state (loc_05adf),
    restores voice mode (data_028e8 -> data_028e7), removes the globe frame tasks,
    enables the two HUD buttons (ui_elements[21,22].flags=0x80), and draws the
    frieze sides + closed-book panel + date/time offscreen (d75a).
    Then fades the screen in (transition dx=0) and tail-jumps ui_head_animate_up.
    Counterpart teardown is loc_018ba. Called once from start (002c) before game_loop.
]]]
attr[seg000:186b]: name = ui_toggle_room_view; comment = [[[
    Shared body of ui_enter_room_view (also entered directly from menu/button
    handlers). Clears the mouse rect, then negs room_view_toggle: when the result
    is >=0 it shows the in-game room view (loc_01877 below), otherwise it jumps to
    ui_show_globe_map_view (the globe/map direction).
    Room path: drains pending UI tasks (run_pending_ui_tasks), resets the scene
    (reset_room_scene_state), restores voice_subtitle_mode from its default, removes
    the globe frame tasks, enables HUD buttons ui_elements[21,22], draws the frieze
    + closed-book + date/time offscreen, then falls into ui_present_room_screen.
]]]
attr[seg000:1877]: comment = ds_00fb >= 0
attr[seg000:1892]: ofs_seg = seg000
attr[seg000:189a]: name = ui_present_room_screen; ofs_seg = seg000; comment = [[[
    Finish presenting the room screen (also called from loc_0eca/0fac/2c8c). When
    pending_room_screen_request is nonzero, jump to draw_room_game_screen for a full
    redraw; otherwise fall into the fade-in path: transition (dx=0) the screen in,
    set fb1 active, service MIDI music, snapshot the PIT counter into
    game_clock_tick_base, and tail-jump ui_head_animate_up.
]]]
attr[seg000:18ba]: name = ui_teardown_room_view; comment = [[[
    Tear down the in-game room view (counterpart of ui_toggle_room_view; also called
    from ui_show_globe_map_view and loc_0aede). Disables HUD elements 20/21/22,
    removes the room frame task, ends the PCM voice loop, drains pending UI tasks,
    and clears sky_fade_active.
]]]
