attr[seg000:ab4f]: name = start_narration_voice_clip; comment = [[[
    Open and queue the next narration .VOC for playback (the PZ\PZNNNI.VOC family).
    ax (in): 3-hex-digit clip index. bx is forced to 0x19 -> directory letter "A"+0x19 = "Z", so the filename create_voc_file_name_from_bx builds is "PZ\PZ<ax3>I.VOC" (international language).
    Guards:
    is_voc_pcm_playing != 0 -> return (do not interrupt the current clip).
    check_pcm_enabled == 0 -> return (PCM disabled, no audio).
    open_pcm_voice_file CF=1 -> bail (missing resource).
    On success: advance _dword_22CC1_pcm_voc_resource_offset by 0x1a, set up the streaming refill via loc_0a9b9, install the loc_0ab92 frame task at interval 1, then [pcm_vtable_start_playback] with si=0x3811.
    Callers: play_intro2_cutscenes (seg000:023d, WORMSUIT narration), seg000:261c, seg000:4340.
]]]
