attr[seg001:002b]: type = u8; name = night_attack_stage; comment = [[[
    Night-attack stage counter.
    0 = inactive (normal room render).
    Incremented at seg000:5058 each time the player enters a room whose data_0000a[room] & 2 flag marks it as a scripted-attack room; cleared to 0 by loc_00b21 (= _clear_night_attack, seg000:b21) and the alternate transition path at seg000:5041.
    1 = the first attack frame (the only `cmp ...,1` site is seg000:83ea); >= 1 keeps the attack scene active.
    While nonzero draw_room_game_screen takes the night_attack_start branch; build_room_command_records swaps in the MASSIVE ATTACK / FIGHT FOR A WHOLE DAY / CALL A WORM verbs in place of TAKE AN ORNITHOPTER; rebuild_and_draw_room_nav_panel skips its per-scene rebuild.
]]]
