attr[seg001:22e3]: type = u8; name = _byte_22E3_sky_skydn_selector; comment = [[[
    SKY/SKYDN sky-palette selector (init 1). open_sky_or_skydn_palette opens resource 0x28 + this (0 -> SKY.HSQ day, 1 -> SKYDN.HSQ dusk).
    Also picks the faded palette span: loc_039b9/loc_0391d/loc_0398c use 0 -> entries 128..207 (bx=0x180, cx=0xf0); nonzero -> 73..223 (bx=0xdb, cx=0x1c5).
    remove_all_frame_tasks (seg000:0920) sets it to 1, so every intro stage (e.g. stage 29's MTG3 desert flyover) uses the SKYDN/73..223 branch; room day/night logic sets it at loc_039ec (1) / loc_03a18 (0).
]]]
